PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
20-turn game. Anhedonia's Univolt drew first blood (turn 4) before a mutual Flopie/Univolt trade on turn 5, bare-form interrupted by Onion's Foxparks against Maraith. Anhedonia's Suzaku chipped Onion (8->5, turn 8) while Onion's Flopie chipped back (10->9->8). Anhedonia's Reindrix/Univolt destroyed Onion's Flopie and pressured Onion (turn 10), then Onion's Cryolinx bare-form interrupted Anhedonia's buffed Digtoise (turn 11) and Onion's Dinossom fully nullified (paid Soul) Anhedonia's Jormuntide Ignis swing (turn 13). Anhedonia's Univolt/Reindrix continued the squeeze (5 to 3, turn 14), and turn 15 saw a flurry of interrupts - Onion's own Lily's Strategy buffed board destroyed Anhedonia's Univolt via Flopie, while Onion's Reindrix and Foxparks bare-form interrupted Anhedonia's Chikipi and Digtoise respectively in the same turn. Anhedonia's Reptyro closed it out turn 20 (3 to 0).


